The deterministic blank Room Code tile, as a patch (Phase 5).

Apply it to pin a code containing an I and deliver it 900ms *after* the tiles
mount, which is the whole of the repro: an I that is not in a `<Text>`'s first
committed render used to lay out 0pt wide and paint nothing on tvOS. Change the
900 to 60 for the other delivery timing; both blanked 4/4 before the fix and
drew 4/4 after it.

    git apply tools/blank-tile-repro.patch
    python3 tools/blank-tile-watch.py 4 --keep before-900
    git apply -R tools/blank-tile-repro.patch

It is a patch rather than a flag in the app because it is an experiment, and
the product has no business carrying a pinned room code.

